      "widgets_values": [
        "## Clothing: upload references and Run\n\n1. Upload your main photo and each reference with **Upload**.\n2. Edit the green instructions if needed, then press **Run**.\n3. Your result is saved under `NoctQ_Edit/Clothing`.\n\n`<image1>` = base, `<image2>` = clothing.\n\nFor just one change, open the matching **Face**, **Pose** or **Clothing** workflow. **All** uses all four photos. Clear, uncropped faces, visible limbs and clear garment photos work best. A full-body main photo helps with pose or full-dress changes.\n\nReference images guide the generation; exact likeness, pose and garment reproduction can vary. The editor may also change nearby details.\n\nDraft size: 640 pixel budget, preserving the main photo's proportions. Output size comes from the first reference, so the canvas stays aligned.\n\nBuilt with Qwen. Modified from ComfyUI's Qwen Image 2.1 edit template (0.11.70). Existing Noct Q V4 weights; no extra model download. See NoctQ-LICENSE.txt / NoctQ-NOTICE.txt and doc/comfyui.md for sources and tested settings."
      ],
      "title": "Upload guide"
    }
